        <item>
            <title>1.45.11</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.11</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: fractional item quantities (e.g. 2.5) are sent correctly instead of being rounded down.</li>
<li>Fixed: the Square footage settings field accepts decimals.</li>
<li>Commission Preview shows a live Final Total that drops as the incentive rises.</li>
<li>Generate Docs is disabled once documents exist, with a clearer "being generated" message.</li>
<li>Clearer outgoing-arrow "sent" icon; Submit Sale copy/form tweaks; Pricing Zones required-field marker.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
