        <item>
            <title>1.45.9</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.9</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: Price-Not-Applicable items can now be removed from an estimate after being added.</li>
<li>The generated-documents list now rides on every proposal, change-order, and submit-sale payload.</li>
<li>Close button on the Submit Sale form; the yes/no buttons are now fully tappable.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
