        <item>
            <title>1.45.8</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.8</h3>
<ul>
<li>Submit Sale sends the consultant email, sale price/date, and commission (rate + amount) with the sale; commission rules and amount now ride on every proposal and change-order payload.</li>
<li>Commission is paid on the final, post-incentive total; the Commission Preview tool uses the Final Total and limits the incentive slider to the employee's range.</li>
<li>Wider "Input" column in the item tables.</li>
<li>"Send to client to sign" now requires the deposit to be sent or paid first.</li>
<li>Fixed: Price-Not-Applicable items can be added to an estimate again.</li>
<li>Fixed: freshly generated documents show immediately instead of the old PDF.</li>
<li>Fixed: combined-cap incentive minimum is enforced when the value tier changes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
